// annotations/MyAnnotation.fol — package source file in package "annotations"
// Spec: language-ref.md > Annotations and Decorators
// Grammar: object-declaration
//
// An ANNOTATION is a static object that carries data. It is declared as a
// co.object with `for=annotation`.
//
// Directives and pragmas cannot be user-defined — they are language internals.

_ co.object->(for=annotation) = {
    value   co.string;
    enabled co.bool;
}
